# Design-system cards for Claude Design. design/authored/ is committed source; design/dist/ is generated
# by `npm run design` and is what gets pushed. Already matched by the `dist/` rule above — spelled out so
# that tightening it to `/dist/` doesn't silently start committing ~1.7 MiB of inlined base64 per rebuild.
design/dist/

# Local-only dev notes / planning artifacts (kept out of the public repo)
.dev/
BLIP.md

# Tutor-avatar generation: keep the curated final art (single-*/sheet-transparent/animation/preview/meta),
# but ignore the multi-MB raw generation sheets — regenerable scratch, not referenced by the app.
src/assets/tutor-avatars/**/raw-*
